          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Flawless Hearing"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "An aolaz has an incredible sense of hearing. It can hear any sound made within 1,000 feet as though it were only 5 feet away from the source of the sound, and any sound within 1 mile as though it were only 30 feet away from the source of the sound. An aolaz's hearing is a precise sense."
            },
