        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Roll"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The aolaz tucks its head down and rolls up into an armored sphere. While Rolling, an aolaz has AC 44, Fort +37, Ref +29, Will +33, and Speed 100 feet, but it can't use its trunk Strikes or its Ultrasonic Blast. It can make foot Strikes while rolling, but only as part of a Trample. The aolaz can use this action again to unroll and resume its standing form."
            },
