        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Ultrasonic Blast"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, evocation, sonic)\n\nThe aolaz releases a tremendous blast of sonic energy from its trunk in a 150-foot line, dealing 12d10 sonic damage. The frequency of this sound is such that it is completely imperceptible to humanoids, but the damage it wreaks is all too evident. Each creature in the area must attempt a 40 Fortitude save. The aolaz can't use Ultrasonic Blast again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage and is stunned 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is stunned 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is stunned 3."
            },
